# RootneX CyberWatch

### Windows-based System Monitoring & Troubleshooting Toolkit

A lightweight command-line toolkit built with **Batch Script**, **CMD**, and **PowerShell** for Windows system administration, network diagnostics, security auditing, and automated maintenance.

<p>
<img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Platform-Windows-0078D6?style=for-the-badge&logo=windows&logoColor=white">
<img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-Batch%20Script-4CAF50?style=for-the-badge">
<img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/PowerShell-Supported-5391FE?style=for-the-badge&logo=powershell">
<img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-success?style=for-the-badge">
</p>

</div>

---

# Overview

RootneX CyberWatch is an interactive Windows administration toolkit that centralizes multiple monitoring and troubleshooting utilities into a single console application.

It provides administrators with quick access to system performance monitoring, network diagnostics, firewall inspection, security analysis, maintenance utilities, and reporting tools without requiring third-party software.

---

# Features

## 🖥 Server Monitoring

- CPU Usage
- RAM Usage
- Disk Usage
- Running Services
- Process Monitoring
- System Uptime

---

## 💻 Client Monitoring

- Remote Ping
- Logged-in Users
- Shared Folder Detection
- Remote Disk Information
- Remote Restart & Shutdown

---

## 🌐 Network Monitoring

- Ping
- Continuous Ping
- Traceroute
- DNS Lookup
- Netstat Connections

---

## 🔥 Firewall Monitoring

- Firewall Status
- Domain Profile
- Private Profile
- Public Profile
- Firewall Rules

---

## 🔐 Security & Logs

- Windows Event Logs
- Security Logs
- Failed Login Detection
- Antivirus Status
- Open Ports

---

## 📊 Auto Monitoring

- CPU Alert
- RAM Alert
- Network Alert
- Live System Monitoring

---

## ❤️ System Health Check

- CHKDSK
- System File Checker (SFC)
- Network Connectivity Test
- Critical Services Check
- System Information

---

## 🔍 Network Scan Tools

- Ping Sweep
- Port Scanner
- ARP Scanner
- Basic Vulnerability Check

---

## ⚙ Advanced Tools

- DNS Lookup
- IP Information
- WHOIS Lookup

---

## 📈 Reports & Dashboard

- System Report
- Network Report
- Security Report

---

## 📡 Live Traffic Monitor

- Established Connections
- Listening Ports
- Network Statistics

---

## 🛠 Maintenance Tools

- Flush DNS Cache
- Clear Temporary Files
