# Technologies Used

| Technology | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| Batch Script | Main Application Logic |
| CMD | Windows Command Utilities |
| PowerShell | Automation & Advanced Commands |
| WMIC | Hardware & System Information |
| Netsh | Network & Firewall Management |
| Netstat | Network Monitoring |
| Windows Utilities | Built-in Administrative Tools |

---

# Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ahaliMz/CyberWatch.git
```

Go to project directory

```bash
cd CyberWatch
```

Run the application

```bash
src\cyberwatch.bat
```

> **Run as Administrator** for full functionality.

